  "description": "\"Your husband must be… ridiculously handsome…”\n\nLeah Uzkal, who grew up obsessed with good looks due to her mother’s last wish, is shocked when her arranged marriage partner is King Mikrok of Fritan, the War Demon. Refusing to marry a man she’s never seen, she decides to run away—until she bumps into the most handsome man ever.\n\n“Who are you? State your name and status.”\n\n“I’m Leah Uzkal… your future wife. ♥”\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
